2026-06-06T19:43:39Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Beat-synced-clip-patterns-cut-and-baby-scratch.md	Beat-synced clip patterns. Reworked the sampler voice into a pattern engine (Pattern enum + SampleVoice::next_frame, fractional interpolating reads). Cut = forward gated on/off at the beat division (eighth note from the pad BPM; ~1/8s fallback) → rhythmic cutting ('over and silent'). BabyScratch = a read head bounces across a div-length slice, audible both ways ('over and back'). Straight unchanged (all prior pad tests green). Focused pad ; cycles play→cut→scratch; pad cell shows the pattern label. Tests: cut has silent + pass-through frames; baby-scratch output rises-then-falls on a ramp (reversal); cycle rotates. README/help updated. 133 lib + all suites green; fmt/clippy clean.
