2026-06-07T12:10:43Z	Matt Reider	accepted	termkrush/Activate-and-deactivate-pads-with-hard-or-soft-fade.md	Pad activation with hard or soft fade. Per-pad envelope (pad_env→pad_env_target, stepped per block by pad_fade: 1.0 hard, 0.02 soft ~0.3s); mix_voices multiplies voices by env and drops them once a pad fades fully off. set_pad_active(i, active, soft) + pad_active/pad_env; trigger implies active(hard) so one-shots always sound; pads stack (independent envelopes). TUI: f toggles the focused pad's activation (soft); cell shows 'off' when inactive. Tests: hard-off silent + voices dropped; soft-off fades gradually (env between 0 and 1, still sounding); tui f toggles. fmt + clippy --workspace + 8 suites green.
