2026-06-08T08:06:40Z	Matt Reider	delivered	termkrush/Bug-clip-editor-audition-plays-the-whole-selection-not-the-active-handle.md	Root cause confirmed by you: it 'worked' before zoom because coarse handle moves are audible when playing from the start; zoomed in, nudging the OUT handle a few ms while Space plays from the START makes the end-change inaudible. Fix: Space now auditions ~1.5s AT the active handle — in-handle plays forward from in, out-handle plays the run-up TO out (mix.audition_region). So zoom to the end, nudge out, Space, and you hear exactly where the cut lands. Test (exit 0): out-handle audition is a short one-shot that ends, not the whole clip. clippy + 8 suites exit 0. DELIVERED — zoom in on the out handle, move it, Space should now play right at the cut.
